From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4evy <git@evy.pink>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: metaedit: share a configurable commit edit transaction

Separate revision selection from metadata mutation and extract the
transaction-backed editing path behind dedicated argument and policy types

Keep metaedit behavior unchanged while allowing sibling commands to choose
status text, target signing, and descendant metadata preservation
---
